{"id":"word:hebrew:H623","type":"word","title":"אָסָף","subtitle":"H623 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"Asaph , the name of three Israelites, and of the family of the first","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to אָסָף (H623) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-pr-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 46 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"אָסָף (ʼÂçâph) means Asaph , the name of three Israelites, and of the family of the first First listed occurrence: 1Chr 6 24."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"אָסָף","transliteration":"ʼÂçâph","pronunciation":"aw-sawf'","strong":"H623","lemmaId":"hebrew:H623","partOfSpeech":"n-pr-m","forms":["לְ/אָ֫סָ֥ף","אָסָ֔ף","אָסָ֖ף","אָסָ֥ף","אָסָֽף"],"morphs":[["HNp",27],["HR/Np",15],["HC/Np",4]]},"definitions":{"short":"Asaph , the name of three Israelites, and of the family of the first","usage":"Asaph.","full":"H623. Asaph אָסָף proper name, masculine ( gatherer , compare Phoenician proper name, feminine אספת ) 1 father of יוֺאָח the recorder 2Kin 18:18 , 37 = Isa 36:3 , 22 . 2 one of David's chief musicians, a Levite, son of Berechiah 1Chr 6:24 (twice in verse) (|| הֵימָן v. 6:18 , אֵיתָן v. 6:29 see these names); 15:17 (|| Heman & Ethan, all called) הַמְּשֹׁרֲרִים 15:19 ; see also 16:5 (twice in verse); 16:7 compare 16:37 (|| Heman & Jeduthun 16:41 ; 16:42 ); 25:9 , named with Heman & Jeduthun also 25:6 ; 2Chr 5:12 ; 35:15 ; Psa 50:1 ; Psalm 73:1-83:18 are ascribed to Asaph; compare also וְאָסָף דָוִיד בִּימֵי Neh 12:46 ; he is called also הַחֹזֶה 2Chr 29:30 , compare עַליְֿדֵיהַמֶּלֶךְ הַנִּבָּא אָסָף 1Chr 25:2 ; repeated mention is made also of sons of Asaph בְּנֵיאָֿסָף , sons, descendants, and pupils, or those who sang and played after his manner 25:1 (|| Heman & Jeduthun) 25:2 ; 25:2 ; called הַמְּשֹׁרֲרִים 2Chr 35:15 ; Ezra 2:41 ; Neh 7:44 ; 11:22 , compare Ezra 3:10 ; performing service of purification, Hezekiah's time 2Chr 29:13 ; one of them prophesying 20:14 ; — 1Chr 26:1 for אָסָף בְּנֵי read אֶבְיָסָף בְּנֵי , compare 9:19 ; on זִכְרִי 9:15 , זַבְדִּי Neh 11:17 , זַכּוּר 12:35 , called בֶּןאָֿסָף , see these names. 3 keeper of king's park Neh 2:8 .","rootNote":"from 622 ; collector ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 6 24","keyReferences":["1Chr 6 24","1Chr 6 24","1Chr 9 15","1Chr 15 17","1Chr 15 19","1Chr 16 5","1Chr 16 5","1Chr 16 7"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":46,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 6 24","book":"1Chr","chapter":6,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אָסָ֔ף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 6 24","book":"1Chr","chapter":6,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אָסָ֥ף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 9 15","book":"1Chr","chapter":9,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אָסָֽף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 15 17","book":"1Chr","chapter":15,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אָסָ֖ף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 15 19","book":"1Chr","chapter":15,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אָסָ֖ף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 16 5","book":"1Chr","chapter":16,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אָסָ֥ף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 16 5","book":"1Chr","chapter":16,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/אָסָ֖ף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 16 7","book":"1Chr","chapter":16,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אָסָ֖ף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 16 37","book":"1Chr","chapter":16,"verse":37,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/אָסָ֖ף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 25 1","book":"1Chr","chapter":25,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אָסָף֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 25 2","book":"1Chr